From 9643f137c6d8cdc636e3c6ea88d265a1f46521da Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 5656565566 <contact@home56.top>
Date: Fri, 14 Aug 2026 20:00:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] frameworks: stabilize NativeBridge first-launch recovery

Persist candidate results for each application and system version, pin verified
backends after a stability window, and stop recovery after all candidates are
exhausted. Crashes in helper or service processes switch only their own backend
without closing the foreground task.

Recognize pre-top launch processes that are not yet bound to an ActivityRecord,
remove stale starting windows, and relaunch the selected fallback backend with
the original task ID.

